==Battleground==
*1 [[M. Bison (Enemy)|M. Bison]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

